# Regression vectors for the fixes listed in REVIEW.md.
### a4-direct-high-to-low
cfg high=30 low=10 deadband=2 delay=0 escalate=0
init 0
s 1 35
s 2 5
---
cfg
NORMAL
HIGH TO_HIGH@1:35.000
LOW TO_LOW@2:5.000
### a3-deadband-return-is-strict
cfg high=30 low=10 deadband=2 delay=0 escalate=0
init 0
s 1 35
s 2 28
s 3 27.9
---
cfg
NORMAL
HIGH TO_HIGH@1:35.000
HIGH
NORMAL TO_NORMAL@3:27.900
### a6a-recovery-sample-is-evaluated
cfg high=30 low=10 deadband=2 delay=0 escalate=0
init 0
s 1 20
sf 2 0
s 3 35
---
cfg
NORMAL
NORMAL
FAULT TO_FAULT@2:0.000
HIGH TO_NORMAL@3:35.000 TO_HIGH@3:35.000
### a12-tick-back-in-time-ignored
