### a10-catchup-starts-episode
cfg high=30 low=10 deadband=2 delay=0 escalate=100
init 0
maint 0 on
s 10 35
maint 20 off
tick 200
---
cfg
NORMAL
NORMAL
HIGH
HIGH TO_HIGH@20:35.000
HIGH ESCALATE@200:35.000
